<section class="text-size-4">
  <h2 data-toc-exclude>IA use cases</h2>

  <div class="fragment mt-200r">
    <h4>Generate complete tests</h4>
    <p class="mt-50">Give your coding agents <strong>detailed test steps</strong> to implement</p>
    <p class="mt-25">
      <i class="emo emo-36 emoji-point-right"></i>The more detailed the more efficient
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="fragment mt-200r">
    <h4>Refactoring</h4>
    <p class="mt-50">Implement tests with the <strong>Recorder</strong>,<br>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;and ask your agent to <strong>apply project's norms</strong> (page objects,
      custom
      fixtures...)</p>
  </div>

  <div class="fragment mt-200r">
    <h4>Migration</h4>
    <p class="mt-50">To migrate tests from Cypress, Selenium, or something else</p>
    <ul>
      <li>On a legacy project, ask your agent to transcribe existing tests to plain text<br>
        – <strong>test steps</strong> and <strong>expectations</strong> in <strong>markdown format</strong></li>
      <li>On the new project, ask to generate tests from these text files</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

</section>